WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.450
What breaks in production?

2
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:06.617
A run with findings read as evidence of
a control leads to a go on a fleet with

3
00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:09.200
gaps; the check result in every record,

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.950
and a go or no-go that fails
until the run passes, guard it.

5
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.950
A file edited after recording is
caught by the hashes, by name.

6
00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.138
A removed record breaks the chain.

7
00:00:19.138 --> 00:00:24.412
Advanced hunting only keeps thirty days,
so the run files results every month.

8
00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:28.817
And a metric computed from a field that
doesn't hold it is a misleading number,

9
00:00:28.817 --> 00:00:32.020
so the kit says not computed,
and where the number lives.
